{
  "name": "HOC Request Automation",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-start",
      "name": "How to connect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 40],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Home of Creativity → Laravel\n\n1. Publish this workflow so the production webhook is live.\n2. Point Laravel `N8N_WEBHOOK_URL` at:\n   `http://127.0.0.1:5678/webhook/hoc-events`\n3. Match `HOC_N8N_SECRET` / `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` (`change-me` locally).\n4. Optional n8n env: `HOC_API_URL`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_STAFF_CHAT_ID`.\n\nIf n8n runs in Docker, set `HOC_API_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8000`.\n\nThe webhook answers immediately so `php artisan serve` does not deadlock when n8n calls Laravel back."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-laravel",
      "name": "Laravel Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 440],
      "webhookId": "hoc-events",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "hoc-events",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "normalize-event",
      "name": "Normalize Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 440],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst headers = raw.headers || {};\nconst body = (raw.body && typeof raw.body === 'object' && !Array.isArray(raw.body))\n  ? raw.body\n  : raw;\n\nconst provided = String(\n  headers['x-n8n-secret'] ||\n  headers['X-N8N-Secret'] ||\n  headers['x-webhook-secret'] ||\n  ''\n).trim();\nconst expected = String($env.HOC_N8N_SECRET || 'change-me');\n\nif (provided && provided !== expected) {\n  throw new Error('Invalid webhook secret');\n}\n\nconst event = String(body.event || '').trim();\nconst requestNumber = String(body.request_number || '').trim();\nif (!event || !requestNumber) {\n  throw new Error('event and request_number are required');\n}\n\nconst incoming = (body.payload && typeof body.payload === 'object') ? body.payload : {};\nconst title = String(incoming.title || '');\nconst description = String(incoming.description || '');\nconst text = `${title} ${description}`.toLowerCase();\n\nconst departments = [];\nconst rules = [\n  { department: 'branding', pattern: /logo|identity|brand|هوية|شعار|هوية بصرية/ },\n  { department: '3d_visualization', pattern: /booth|exhibition|3d|جناح|معرض|مجسم/ },\n  { department: 'media', pattern: /social|ads|campaign|tiktok|meta|سوشيال|إعلان|حملة/ },\n  { department: 'web', pattern: /web|site|dashboard|موقع|لوحة/ },\n  { department: 'print', pattern: /packaging|menu|card|طباعة|تغليف|منيو/ },\n];\nfor (const rule of rules) {\n  if (rule.pattern.test(text)) {\n    departments.push(rule.department);\n  }\n}\nif (departments.length === 0) {\n  departments.push('creative_direction');\n}\n\nconst client = incoming.client && typeof incoming.client === 'object' ? incoming.client : {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    event,\n    request_number: requestNumber,\n    status: body.status || null,\n    title,\n    description,\n    client,\n    incoming_payload: incoming,\n    ai_analysis: {\n      summary: title ? `Intake analysis for ${title}` : `Intake analysis for ${requestNumber}`,\n      departments,\n      estimated_days: 10 + departments.length * 3,\n      confidence: 'heuristic',\n    },\n    quotation: {\n      odoo_quotation_id: `Q-${requestNumber}`,\n      odoo_partner_id: client.odoo_partner_id || `P-${requestNumber}`,\n    },\n    briefs: departments.map((department) => ({\n      department,\n      brief: `${title}: ${description}`.slice(0, 400),\n      clickup_task_id: `CU-MOCK-${department}-${requestNumber}`,\n    })),\n    notify_staff: true,\n    api_url: String($env.HOC_API_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000').replace(/\\/$/, ''),\n    callback_secret: String($env.HOC_N8N_SECRET || 'change-me'),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "is-submitted",
      "name": "Is Submitted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [680, 440],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-submitted",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}",
              "rightValue": "REQUEST_SUBMITTED",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals",
                "name": "filter.operator.equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
